{"id":"n81394-1-7","stage":4,"title":"친숙하다 · 亲近","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81394-1-7-1","ko":"여자 친구랑 잘 지내?","zh":"你和女朋友相处得怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"3","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"친구랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구랑","audio":"/audio/74f6c9e10aa7a90f70e1.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지내?","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내","audio":"/audio/648b1c68226126e85b66.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":